  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/08/BousTales1.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>(35 fotos) Aquest dissabte ha sigut el dia del bou del poble a les festes d&#39;estiu de Tales i se li ha retut homenatge a Rafa L&oacute;pez Badenes, mort recentement, abans</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/08/BousTales2.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>de soltar l&#39;exemplar de la ramederia Torrestrella, que s&#39;ha embolat de nit.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tales17bousdissabte/img_2602.jpg\" alt=\"img_2602\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tales17bousdissabte/img_2604.jpg\" alt=\"img_2604\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tales17bousdissabte/img_2606.jpg\" alt=\"img_2606\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tales17bousdissabte/img_2608.jpg\" alt=\"img_2608\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tales17bousdissabte/img_2611.jpg\" alt=\"img_2611\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tales17bousdissabte/img_2613.jpg\" alt=\"img_2613\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tales17bousdissabte/img_2614.jpg\" alt=\"img_2614\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tales17bousdissabte/img_2619.jpg\" alt=\"img_2619\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tales17bousdissabte/img_26